+- Moving a task (`/move`) is a delete from the task's project plus a create in the
+  destination: the actor must be a manager of the task's project and a contributor
+  or manager of the destination. The destination must be readable by the actor
+  (else 404) and not archived (else 409). The task keeps its ID, title, status and
+  assignee, so the assignee must be a contributor or manager of the destination
+  (else 400). Moving to the task's own project → 400.
